{"id":"vod_sn_36487","vodId":"36487","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔法咪路咪路","name_cn":"魔法咪路咪路","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1a546a39204a53fefba564aaae5e6342.jpg"},"summary":"南枫（中原麻衣 配音）是一位活泼可爱的少女，她暗恋着名为结木摄（德本恭敏 配音）的男孩，然而，腼腆的她无法正视自己的感情，只能将这份爱意默默地埋藏在心底。一次偶然中，南枫走进了一家魔法商店，买回了一只附有精灵的马克杯，在念出杯底篆刻的咒语之后，一只名叫咪路（小樱悦子 配音）的精灵出现在了她的面前。就这样，南枫开始了和咪路的共同生活。　　平日里温文尔雅但一发起火来就会变身修罗的莉露姆，身材矮小个性呆萌的王子姆路（钉宫理惠 配音）、有些色色的但十分可爱的亚西吉（铃木晶子 配音），除了咪路外，这个世界上还存在着许许多多的精灵。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":172,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JifQ9AhjkE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7e11m7GxVB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zvY2GVVYbT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LMHLeaSEJ41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TpRtwKmD7d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3XkZ4YfHE61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Xfs76xKd8L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/90EZZL6EeC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nxMm4sXbik1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s2qZqHt37D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/racVsfMK4y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jd3BYmuP0z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fXY3Xxn7751/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/spFNrnWSTS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.r